* promote(ZZ,type of PadicNumber): promote_lpZZ_cmtype of PadicNumber_rp.  promote a number to a p-adic field
* numeric(PadicNumber): numeric_lpZZ_cmPadicNumber_rp.  convert a p-adic number to a real number
