exp(PadicNumber) -- p-adic exponential function
***********************************************

  * Function: *note exp: (Macaulay2Doc)exp,
  * Usage: 
        exp x
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, the p-adic exponential of x; 

Description
===========

Returns the $p$-adic exponential of $x$, defined by the power series $\exp_p x
= \sum_{n=0}^\infty x^n / n!$.  The series converges when $|x|_p <
p^{-1/(p-1)}$.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : exp QQ_7 7                                                             |
|                                                                            |
|o1 = 1 + 1*7^1 + 4*7^2 + 2*7^3 + 3*7^5 + 2*7^6 + 4*7^7 + 3*7^8 + 4*7^9 +    |
|     2*7^10 + 4*7^11 + 1*7^13 + 1*7^14 + 3*7^15 + 3*7^16 + 4*7^17 + 5*7^18 +|
|     1*7^19                                                                 |
|                                                                            |
|o1 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                  |
|       7                                                                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : log oo                                                                 |
|                                                                            |
|o2 = 1*7^1                                                                  |
|                                                                            |
|o2 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                  |
|       7                                                                    |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

An error is raised if the series does not converge.

* Menu:

* log(PadicNumber): log_lpPadicNumber_rp.  p-adic logarithm function

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note exp(PadicNumber): exp_lpPadicNumber_rp, -- p-adic exponential
    function
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

