log(PadicNumber) -- p-adic logarithm function
*********************************************

  * Function: *note log: (Macaulay2Doc)log,
  * Usage: 
        log x
  * Inputs:
      * x, a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, the p-adic logarithm of x; 

Description
===========

Returns the $p$-adic logarithm of $x$, defined by the power series $\log_p x =
\sum_{n=1}^\infty (-1)^{n-1}(x-1)^n/n$.  The series converges when $|x - 1|_p <
1$.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : log exp QQ_7 7       |
|                          |
|o1 = 1*7^1                |
|                          |
|o1 : QQ  (of precision 20)|
|       7                  |
+--------------------------+

Caveat
======

An error is raised if the series does not converge.

