promote(ZZ,type of PadicNumber) -- promote a number to a p-adic field
*********************************************************************

  * Function: *note promote: (Macaulay2Doc)promote,
  * Usage: 
        promote(x, kk)
        x_kk
  * Inputs:
      * x, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, a *note rational number:
        (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, or a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,,
      * kk, a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, 

Description
===========

Promote an integer, rational, or $p$-adic number to the given $p$-adic field.
The subscript operator *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us, may also be used.

+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : promote(3, QQ_7)                                                      |
|                                                                           |
|o1 = 3                                                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o1 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                 |
|       7                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : promote(3/2, QQ_7)                                                    |
|                                                                           |
|o2 = 5 + 3*7^1 + 3*7^2 + 3*7^3 + 3*7^4 + 3*7^5 + 3*7^6 + 3*7^7 + 3*7^8 +   |
|     3*7^9 + 3*7^10 + 3*7^11 + 3*7^12 + 3*7^13 + 3*7^14 + 3*7^15 + 3*7^16 +|
|     3*7^17 + 3*7^18 + 3*7^19                                              |
|                                                                           |
|o2 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                 |
|       7                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : 3_(QQ_7)                                                              |
|                                                                           |
|o3 = 3                                                                     |
|                                                                           |
|o3 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                 |
|       7                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (3/2)_(QQ_7)                                                          |
|                                                                           |
|o4 = 5 + 3*7^1 + 3*7^2 + 3*7^3 + 3*7^4 + 3*7^5 + 3*7^6 + 3*7^7 + 3*7^8 +   |
|     3*7^9 + 3*7^10 + 3*7^11 + 3*7^12 + 3*7^13 + 3*7^14 + 3*7^15 + 3*7^16 +|
|     3*7^17 + 3*7^18 + 3*7^19                                              |
|                                                                           |
|o4 : QQ  (of precision 20)                                                 |
|       7                                                                   |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+

