numeric(ZZ,PadicNumber) -- convert a p-adic number to a real number
*******************************************************************

  * Function: *note numeric: (Macaulay2Doc)numeric,
  * Usage: 
        numeric(prec, x)
        numeric x
  * Inputs:
      * prec, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, number of bits of precision;
      * x, a *note p-adic number: PadicNumber,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note real number: (Macaulay2Doc)RR,, 

Description
===========

Converts a $p$-adic number to a floating-point real number by first lifting to
*note QQ: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : numeric QQ_7 5       |
|                          |
|o1 = 5                    |
|                          |
|o1 : RR (of precision 53) |
+--------------------------+
|i2 : numeric(100, QQ_7 5) |
|                          |
|o2 = 5                    |
|                          |
|o2 : RR (of precision 100)|
+--------------------------+

